        {
            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "I suspect this is actually the module working as intended, and it just requires a second `toggle()`, but:\r\n\r\n```lua\r\nf = {\r\n    1, 2, 3, 4\r\n}\r\n\r\n-- Mini.Splitjoin.toggle()\r\n\r\nf = {1, 2, 3, 4}\r\n```\r\n\r\nMy brain was expecting:\r\n```lua\r\nf = {\r\n    1,\r\n    2,\r\n    3,\r\n    4,\r\n}\r\n```",
            "created_at": "2023-03-10T14:21:58Z",
            "html_url": "https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/issues/260#issuecomment-1463874116",
